Package: devjam-science-opensesame-psychopy
Version: 1.10-1
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: devjam-science-tools
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: OpenSesame Launcher with PsychoPy
 Desktop launchers for OpenSesame, PsychoPy, PsychoPy Studio and Sigmund
 Analyst in the PsychoPy environment in /opt/psychopy, including an
 OpenSesame launcher that runs as a user service with real-time
 priority. In experiment mode (devjam-science-experiment-mode) that
 OpenSesame runs on the isolated CPU cores; manage-opensesame-affinity
 sets other CPUs.
 .
 opensesamerun-psychopy runs an experiment without the GUI, as a
 replacement for opensesamerun, which no longer works in OpenSesame 4.1.
 It needs the Experiment Manager plugin in the PsychoPy environment.
